DESCRIPTION:Suzanne Lambert  is a DC-based comedian\, internet personality
 \, and general menace. Known as “the Regina George liberal\,” she deliv
 ers engaging and biting wit to an audience of over one million fans across 
 TikTok and Instagram ([handle removed]).\n\nHer style could best be describ
 ed as quick\, sharp\, amused bewilderment\; she pairs strangely strong opin
 ions about inconsequential topics with beauty tips and hot political takes.
  Originally hailing from Georgia\, she had a very normal upbringing in a gu
 n-loving Bible Belt town and remains unaffected to this day.\n\nShe began p
 erforming comedy in 2018 after her ex-boyfriend told her he would dump her 
 if she tried it\; a true win-win scenario! She has performed at nationally 
 acclaimed venues like the DC Improv\, Laughing Skull\, Arlington Drafthouse
 \, Side Splitters and the legendary Friars Club. Suzanne has performed with
  national acts like Mark Normand\, Katherine Blanford and Tony Woods.\n\nCo
 uple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit
  ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves t
 he right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disr
 uptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/c
